{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20006","headline":"西上经灵宝观 · 孟郊","name":"西上经灵宝观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道士无白发，语音灵泉清。\n青松多寿色，白石恒夜明。\n放步霁霞起，振衣华风生。\n真文秘中顶，宝气浮四楹。\n一片古关路，万里今人行。\n上仙不可见，驱策徒西征。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}